flowchart TD
  A[initialize_game<br/>创建玩家与身份] --> B[night_start<br/>进入夜晚]
  B --> C[wolf_action<br/>狼人选择击杀]
  C --> D[seer_action<br/>预言家查验]
  D --> E[witch_action<br/>女巫救人或毒人]
  E --> F[resolve_night<br/>结算夜晚死亡]
  F --> G[day_announcement<br/>主持人公布结果]
  G --> H[speech_round<br/>轮流发言]
  H --> I[vote_round<br/>投票放逐]
  I --> J[resolve_vote<br/>结算放逐]
  J --> K{check_win_condition<br/>判断胜负}
  K -->|未结束| B
  K -->|已结束| L[generate_recap<br/>生成复盘]
